          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "1. Write formulas for the perimeter of: (a) triangle with all sides equal. (b) a regular pentagon (as we have learnt last year, we use the word ‘regular’ to say that all sidelengths and angle measures are equal) (c) a regular hexagon",
